WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.427
Which flat shape has 3 straight sides? Let us think carefully. Count edges and

00:00:05.427 --> 00:00:09.907
vertices or look at the three-dimensional shape’s faces. The answer is triangle.

00:00:09.907 --> 00:00:10.653
Great work!

00:00:11.533 --> 00:00:16.877
Which flat shape has 5 straight sides? Let us think carefully. Count edges and

00:00:16.877 --> 00:00:21.458
vertices or look at the three-dimensional shape’s faces. The answer is pentagon.

00:00:21.458 --> 00:00:22.221
Great work!

00:00:23.033 --> 00:00:28.271
Which flat shape has 6 straight sides? Let us think carefully. Count edges and

00:00:28.271 --> 00:00:33.134
vertices or look at the three-dimensional shape’s faces. The answer is hexagon. Great

00:00:33.134 --> 00:00:33.508
work!

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:39.529
Which flat shape has no straight sides? Let us think carefully. Count edges and

00:00:39.529 --> 00:00:44.323
vertices or look at the three-dimensional shape’s faces. The answer is circle. Great

00:00:44.323 --> 00:00:44.692
work!
